  ($q$pd-446$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$q$, $q$Percentages$q$, 2, null, $q$A store raises the price of a jacket by 50%, and later reduces the new price by 50%. Which describes the overall change from the original price?$q$, $q$["25% decrease","50% increase","25% increase","100% increase"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$With an original price of 100: 100·1.5 = 150; then 150·0.5 = 75. That is a 25% decrease overall.$q$, null),
