  ($q$pd-781$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$q$, $q$Rates and units$q$, 1, null, $q$If 5 packs of batteries cost $20, how much do 9 packs of batteries cost at the same rate?$q$, $q$["$29","$40","$36","$11.11"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$The cost of one is $20/5 = $4. So 9 cost 9 × $4 = $36.$q$, null),
