  ($q$pd-783$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$q$, $q$Probability$q$, 1, null, $q$A bag contains 5 red marbles, 3 blue marbles, and 10 green marbles. If one marble is chosen at random, what is the probability that it is blue?$q$, $q$["1/6","1/3","1/5","5/6"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$There are 5 + 3 + 10 = 18 marbles, and 3 are blue. The probability is 3/18 = 1/6.$q$, null),
